[{"title":"纪梦","author":"湛若水","text":"夜梦自然翁，示我以文字。\n文字大如拳，纸高亦称是。\n卷舒数千年，了了得其意。\n自然尧舜来，禹汤文武继。\n周孔及邹轲，相传有何事。\n可得不可传，人人有诸己。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58268,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬子七月十五日夜同黄慎斋司训周启政上舍宿白云御书阁作","author":"湛若水","text":"床敷第一峰，峰头更高阁。\n超然出尘寰，何用不寥廓。\n万有声臭无，中夜神明跃。\n心在不容玩，自然本无作。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58269,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送惠州守金君滥滨入觐诗","author":"湛若水","text":"循州古循良，绩最今颖川。\n爱民如赤子，无论烹小鲜。\n馀事兼管勾，弹压罗浮烟。\n黄龙与青霞，予同受一廛。\n倾盖即如旧，爱君如爱山。\n今君飞舄去，去去玉皇前。\n前席如访门，莫说轩辕仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58270,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至佛山念二贤怀冼少汾","author":"湛若水","text":"吾念九曲好，似我九回肠。\n怀人隔九曲，念之非他乡。\n有时正远念，神游遍八荒。\n中思如中天，美人在中央。\n嗟哉乎美人，美人安可忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58271,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庞弼唐","author":"湛若水","text":"吾念弼唐好，如我道上唐。\n怀人在唐曲，念之如同乡。\n都俞事已远，仪凤空回翔。\n回翔归何时，救火方皇皇。\n嗟哉乎弼唐，弼唐安可忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58272,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送广州贰守吴白湾赴部","author":"湛若水","text":"上客多黄金，下客无黄金。\n既已无黄金，胶漆亦未深。\n旧云乃刻子，清者一二伦。\n利口佩相印，长者亦沉沦。\n位高金亦多，昔疏今曷亲。\n濯缨见天日，无愧白湾滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58273,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题陈朗溪诗","author":"湛若水","text":"朗溪好优游，溪朗心未朗。\n因究朗从来，明月无云障。\n照见先生心，虚明极高广。\n一溪万溪同，银河同荡漾。\n溪水日日来，溪毛夜夜长。\n此如我心生，仿佛在川上。\n潮汐自将迎，我心断来往。\n溪翁将船游，只在溪下上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58274,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"湛若水","text":"世有阳子居，人将与争席。\n何如睢盱子，十浆已馈食。\n吾道率旷野，孰谓天地窄。\n蹈海谁予从，南山有故宅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58275,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送秋官卢君星野之京诗","author":"湛若水","text":"堂堂伊川子，谗无曲乡行。\n赖有游杨徒，时来问性命。\n二少今游杨，相期定中正。\n一隐鹤园深，一举鹏路永。\n崇朝九万程，养翅六月胜。\n去去淩青霄，行行戒深定。\n援琴送飞翰，极目瞻神圣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58276,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日者多言八字生生未知尽处答之","author":"湛若水","text":"日者誇八字，不绝而生生。\n未知了尽处，六合安能绳。\n多寿人多辱，多寿人多憎。\n尼侨人欲杀，远大何足徵。\n不如生我心，生生合天灵。\n即是无穷门，何必求广成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58277,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移居红岗新楼期非游山泛湖不下呈知己","author":"湛若水","text":"巷无车马迹，学子时时来。\n就床答之问，不答亦已哉。\n吾以复无言，端坐同无怀。\n不追亦不拒，将迎不下台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58278,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千忍亭诗书付孙润先刻石","author":"湛若水","text":"昨霄有好言，喜我润孙贤。\n公艺百忍字，吾且至千焉。\n鸿炉煅顽铁，千炼千精坚。\n自兹化有容，习惯成自然。\n犹闻忍禅师，引虫齧其肩。\n忘己不有身，何物横吾前。\n镵石告后裔，遵此无尤愆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58279,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻陈黎梁六君罗浮舟中为海盗所惊而归作诗嘲之且定重游之期","author":"湛若水","text":"虎溪闻虎声，三笑震天地。\n六逸逢恶少，回车有何事。\n劫去罗浮峰，四百三十二。\n问我重游期，明年正月是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58280,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题易吉甫观心卷","author":"湛若水","text":"易子一心耳，观之者又谁。\n两心相觅处，憧憧日往来。\n不如两置之，中思以无为。\n勿忘与勿助，此间有天机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58281,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓑笠赠洪方二子侑以小诗","author":"湛若水","text":"赠蓑护子身，赠笠护子首。\n自馀身首外，长物亦何取。\n大雨与大旱，槁坐不出门。\n蓑笠时置之，所性有不存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58282,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦诗","author":"湛若水","text":"至后子亥交，梦悟损益义。\n损益之极致，是为六十四。\n无益亦何损，损益可一视。\n阴损而阳生，天运常流易。\n指破长空云，此出在何处。\n以之补损益，平等无复意。\n大易著一致，天下何思虑。\n所以大智人，行其所无事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58283,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禺山除草吟示同志","author":"湛若水","text":"窗前草不除，吾除惟恐后。\n不除恶草根，芝兰安得茂。\n兰德馨通天，草秽虫蛇薮。\n无为无不为，自取为何有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58284,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孙月崖大巡海珠四首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"浮生浮世上，况值此浮宫。\n日照孤根立，波光四面通。\n星槎乘汉上，水镜阅人空。\n洒落来游者，惟应学尔中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58285,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孙月崖大巡海珠四首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"船来知有路，烟塞欲无门。\n世味非前日，潮来到旧痕。\n藤萝偏得意，萧鼓罢芳樽。\n遥想人如玉，生刍孰与论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58286,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孙月崖大巡海珠四首 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"僧贫无裤着，门设亦无扃。\n门设从风入，无扃待月明。\n人情云愈薄，世态昼长冥。\n惟有东流水，可以观我生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58287,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孙月崖大巡海珠四首 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"鸡声闻两岸，寺影界中河。\n渔唱乘除语，孺闻沧浪歌。\n严霜下蔓草，密雨长藤萝。\n穹昊元无际，浮云一片过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58288,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答谢赣州汪周潭督府","author":"湛若水","text":"晨兴纵遥睇，云起南山台。\n悠然生远心，春风启予怀。\n井地久荒芜，老屋风易摧。\n王孙春草生，主人犹未来。\n情萌事自至，神往形亦随。\n故人远念我，寄声相取裁。\n举手谢德意，行驾未可回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58289,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过金泷腰泷吟","author":"湛若水","text":"武溪险瞿塘，不少滟滪堆。\n中流列剑戟，涛舂奋如雷。\n舟行石鏬中，岂不亦危哉。\n江汉舟方颠，正叔坐正危。\n存心即诚敬，达去亦虚猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58290,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黑翠峰参戎赴留都不觉发江湖廊庙之悃","author":"湛若水","text":"黑公自名将，倾盖禺山坡。\n谈兵樽俎间，只手提天戈。\n适当喉舌地，国脉在运河。\n锁钥固荣卫，腹心赖调和。\n文武有吉甫，庙算帝心嘉。\n忠信挞秦楚，一心不在多。\n倭奴偏水战，出没淩苍波。\n短兵慎相接，长技我爪哇。\n丈人出奇计，攻守万无差。\n吾有进取策，并用夫如何。\n请调三土州，家兵强莫过。\n亲裹土粮来，无费我公家。\n功成酬以爵，否则削有加。\n乌艚绝港口，众兵如刈麻。\n二策须兼举，相与灭么么。\n钟鼓闻天地，晏眠嬉且歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58291,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶正禅语之谬送行者","author":"湛若水","text":"迷时固师渡，悟了云自渡。\n此是何等语，千误与万误。\n譬之行丫径，冥行不问路。\n适越而北辕，毫釐千里谬。\n惟有指南车，圣神所默告。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58292,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦诗","author":"湛若水","text":"道林入我梦，万里倏感通。\n即此可悟道，羚羊有何踪。\n饮酒非譬道，酒醉庶形容。\n予曰然非欤，犹堕声臭中。\n一唯谅非难，得之安由从。\n悠悠千载下，对尔心融融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58293,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古三叹 其一 吊屈原","author":"湛若水","text":"龙舟与角黍，天下吊屈原。\n不知自沉后，能使君心悛。\n徒以扬之过，离骚为世传。\n宣圣昔去鲁，微罪兆其端。\n贵戚不易位，龙蛇洞庭渊。\n老死需追召，仁义为两全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58294,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古三叹 其二 岳武穆","author":"湛若水","text":"和议总国命，诸公与长舌。\n颇憾岳武穆，推毂义未彻。\n在军不受命，金牌何叠叠。\n迅雷比席捲，封章拜望阙。\n成功乃归死，义命两无缺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58295,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古三叹 其三 吊厓山","author":"湛若水","text":"厓山吊三忠，三匝三感伤。\n国君死社稷，谋臣死封疆。\n穷厓等死耳，敌忾何堂堂。\n贲育失时势，驱逐如群羊。\n自古多此事，此独遗恨长。\n我祖扫腥膻，克复我冠裳。\n中国所自立，刷耻酬百王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58296,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答颜山农","author":"湛若水","text":"永新颜氏贤，眼底于八环。\n如何昨寄书，劝我立杏坛。\n杏坛宁有几，自生民以还。\n夫我异于是，坛在灵台间。\n至近而至远，随默以随言。\n无行而不与，无地何立焉。\n留心理五典，神越三坟前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58297,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁巳正月十二日抱玄孙","author":"湛若水","text":"我年九十二，为人祖高祖。\n正吉抱玄孙，天光临正午。\n性□不呱呱，面目已靖好。\n我若跻舜年，见尔志于道。\n立此从心根，生生不逾矩。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58298,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次巾石子吕学士南岳韵奉答因招隐","author":"湛若水","text":"昨夜梦怀玉，诗卷来高台。\n巾石好明月，照入我襟怀。\n罗浮志已壮，岂为疾所摧。\n八荒云我闼，瞬息能往来。\n飘飘乘云车，跃跃苍龙随。\n云涛生浩浩，无迹不可裁。\n疑丞孰先后，无乃点与回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58299,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送族孙必进赴配所诫言 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"诫尔出门去，门外有瞿塘。\n吾心有坦途，吾心有康庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58300,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送族孙必进赴配所诫言 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"夷险自己求，天乎人何尤。\n聪明男子身，只在一回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58301,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜徐生一洙从薛中离于罗浮来见赠之六言","author":"湛若水","text":"病足闭关谢客，谁带飞云扣门。\n云是中离弟子，遥宗孺子云孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58302,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再拈六言代简蒋道林未尽之意三首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"俯仰寥寥宇宙，白云抱膝长吟。\n六载星源雁渺，德山遗我好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58303,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再拈六言代简蒋道林未尽之意三首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"前门长扃谢客，凿坯退遁上唐。\n金液池边风月，白玉坛上坐忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58304,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再拈六言代简蒋道林未尽之意三首 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"坐忘不忘之间，中思直到天然。\n问我天然何似，人力丝毫不存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58305,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游南岳至韶州清平市作六言","author":"湛若水","text":"岳游昔在甲辰，郡下交流粼粼。\n拉伴重游过此，顾影犹然旧人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58306,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祭先慈墓于荷塘有感作六言","author":"湛若水","text":"半阴半晴天气，欲行不行痴情。\n寸草报恩罔极，行行恋恋慈茔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58307,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别篇与洪觉山侍御","author":"湛若水","text":"惜别，惜别。\n别期在旦夕，念之令人心恻恻。\n所赖心同天地间，不以远近形迹隔。\n千山月出千山光，万里云收天宇长。\n吾将从此祝融去，武夷见月无相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58308,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺中丞半洲蔡公平二南诗","author":"湛若水","text":"楼台斧钺临边城，神武不杀称天兵。\n潢池弄兵非赤子，生黎熟黎皆苍生。\n安南甫下下海南，一岁两鼓鲸波清。\n功成徒闻万骨朽，轮台诸将同留名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58309,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题衡岳奇游卷赠何生于逵","author":"湛若水","text":"吾闻衡岳有五峰，十年磊磈吾胸中。\n去春春风送我游，梯上云雨迷行踪。\n回车神游十一拍，一拍缥缈鞭苍龙。\n何生仙骨何神通，先我飞锡驻祝融。\n祝融君须我问讯，朱明小憩待秋风。\n何生毛骨本仙侣，许执几杖还相从，吾将拉子游无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58310,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同督学蒋道林罗国子一泉二蒋生叔英本学游罗浮道中短歌因致久留之意","author":"湛若水","text":"前年与君登祝融，今日共上飞云峰。\n我年逾八君望七，如此嘉会能几逢。\n朱陵朱明本一天，风花雪月将无同。\n愿君且莫动归念，无穷花鸟在春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58311,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壮蒋叔英冒夜偕周自正谢振卿登飞云顶","author":"湛若水","text":"薄暮师归不肯从，昏黑七圣皆迷踪。\n久倚门闾望不至，恐陷虎口蚺腹中。\n岂知壮志直前去，穿贯兽穴飞云峰。\n三生笑坐三生石，眼轻四百归鸿蒙。\n蒋生蒋生真士雄，踏碎五岳成虚空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58312,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮归途罗子钟过溪马蹶濡裳诗以唁之","author":"湛若水","text":"罗生惯骑惯著跌，犹然自诿马蹄齧。\n仰面贪看罗浮云，不觉马蹶濡裳舄。\n试问蹶时可动心，打破这敬无处寻。\n凝然定力楚州桥，一泉何讵非天人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58313,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻同志诸贤有欲赴观北戒坛者讶之作韵语","author":"湛若水","text":"重耳无我之所有，我有重耳之所无。\n吾道自足何旁求，逼北赴戒是吾忧，公欲渡湖毋渡湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58314,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殿元石鹿子李子来诗举六字心诀深契道妙予病不能诗为十三字长句代诗酬贺云","author":"湛若水","text":"嗟状元及第气干青云身依日月，犹不忘随处体认天理六字微诀，大学格致诚正修齐治平一囊括。\n经筵进讲启心沃心可以从头说，嗟石鹿子为天下得人知人之哲，为邦家之光为斯文如笺之不绝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58315,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨上舍相甫之京","author":"湛若水","text":"昔日千金求骏骨，而今骏骨满郊坰。\n金台若见终军辈，盍系倭头请万缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58316,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题寄梁海屋","author":"湛若水","text":"浮生浮世海浮船，不谢星槎到海源。\n我欲因君浮海去，海心风月更无边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58317,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"回龙阁落成宴坐志喜","author":"湛若水","text":"黄冠归去心能了，还向君王乞鉴湖。\n无限光风偕众乐，蓬湖花鸟择人无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58318,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢南崖陈光禄寄年谱镌金绝句","author":"湛若水","text":"浮生三万有奇日，年谱篇章亦已多。\n刻付他年堪覆酱，观生真谱又如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58319,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"督学王敬所求惇叙堂中军董容山求贞裕堂记","author":"湛若水","text":"四扁恢恢专使去，徵文蔼蔼两生来。\n百年六月挥炎翰，人讶莲花火里开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58320,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与罗朝选儒能河洛真数送之端州","author":"湛若水","text":"罗生肘后藏真数，阅尽诸方人已多。\n如我自能超六合，乾坤物外奈君何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58321,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送庞惺庵大巡之浙江诗","author":"湛若水","text":"柏台春动秋霜里，豸史旌挥山岳摇。\n呼吸雷风吞日月，吴山小结看春潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58322,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自吟","author":"湛若水","text":"九十东溟一老翁，扶胥歌罢水连空。\n世间不管乘除□，月落潮生收钓筒。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58323,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺王端溪宗伯致政","author":"湛若水","text":"及秋凉冷归澶渊，好事都看未尽年。\n惊醒还应知是梦，风涛万里到江船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58324,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登小金山有感用苏东坡韵","author":"湛若水","text":"轮回莫是窥天窄，苏子德云之再来。\n二老只随归大化，空留渣滓妙高台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58325,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过大庙峡有感","author":"湛若水","text":"为文驱虎思文敏，不谓于今虎昼号。\n白额前山食人脑，可无周处斩蛟刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58326,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿大庙峡营下作","author":"湛若水","text":"寂寂不闻更鼓声，荒荒茅屋十馀楹。\n江风滚滚从天下，咄咄书空大庙营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58327,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度宜章岭途中杯旧","author":"湛若水","text":"荣木欣欣春向暖，向来古木摧为柴。\n随车男子今何在，道士罗浮又复来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58328,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至南岳书院寄常德蒋道林督学","author":"湛若水","text":"岳顶登歌寄道林，一翁九十云千寻。\n八程不惜来嘉会，君来不来春亦深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58329,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题守书院道士赵竹坡壁","author":"湛若水","text":"管城食肉巧东坡，去竹存坡奈俗何。\n师徒藉甚吾书院，遍植琅玕绕院过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58330,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄衡山曹近斋上舍","author":"湛若水","text":"近斋高卧不从铨，何不移家近院村。\n流水行云皆学我，奇峰环立侍桥门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58331,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感湖南道兵宪胡石屏衡州南岳礼际周至小诗二绝以致谢忱 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"回雁峰前逢使君，冲风冒雨来追云。\n若非底事归期速，天柱坛前其讲闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58332,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]